  "measured_live_corrections": [
    "app.plane.so serves GET but returns 405 for POST/PATCH/DELETE; api.plane.so accepts writes",
    "no sub-work-items endpoint (404): a sub work item is a work item carrying `parent`",
    "duplicate external_id on POST /work-items/ returns 409 with the existing id in the body",
    "POST /cycles/ requires project_id in the body and rejects the spelling `project`",
    "cycles enforce name uniqueness and answer 400 without an id, unlike work items",
    "?external_source=&external_id= resolves a single object for work-items and modules, ignored by cycles",
    "worklogs return 404 'Worklog is not enabled for the project' on this project",
    "an invalid API key returns 403, not 401"
  ],
